        reviewReason  "transcribed by a model from the article's Table 1 and re-read once; not yet read back by a human";
    }
    Pc
    {
        origin        measured;
        method        "IUPAC recommended value: the critical evaluation of every published measurement by the IUPAC critical-properties group (3.63 MPa, stored as 36.3 bar)";
